{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This backend communicates directly with Google’s REST API — no third-party SDK","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is required. Authentication is handled via an OAuth 2.0 access token passed as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bearer"},{"text":" header on every request.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Google Drive uses file IDs rather than paths to identify files and folders.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This backend bridges the path-based ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CloudFileSystem"},{"text":" protocol onto Google Drive’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID-based API by walking the folder hierarchy to resolve Ensembles paths","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ensembleId\/events\/file.json"},{"text":") to Google Drive folder and file IDs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Resolved IDs are cached in internal dictionaries to minimize API calls. The cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is invalidated when items are deleted or when not-found errors indicate stale entries.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two initialization paths are available:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Simple: static access token (app manages refresh externally)","let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(accessToken: \"your-token\")","","\/\/ Authenticator: auto-refreshes expired tokens","let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: authenticator)"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Setup","anchor":"Setup"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Go to the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/console.cloud.google.com\/","type":"reference"},{"text":" and create a project","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enable the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Google Drive API"}]},{"text":" under ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"APIs & Services → Library"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create an ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OAuth 2.0 Client ID"}]},{"text":" under ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"APIs & Services → Credentials"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS\/macOS apps, choose “iOS” application type and enter your bundle ID"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the redirect URI (typically "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.googleusercontent.apps.YOUR-CLIENT-ID:\/oauthredirect"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure the authenticator and file system:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let config = GoogleDriveAuthenticator.Configuration(","    clientID: \"YOUR-CLIENT-ID.apps.googleusercontent.com\",","    redirectURI: \"com.googleusercontent.apps.YOUR-CLIENT-ID:\/oauthredirect\"",")","let authenticator = GoogleDriveAuthenticator(configuration: config)","try await authenticator.authorize(presenting: window)","","let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: authenticator)","let ensemble = CoreDataEnsemble(","    ensembleIdentifier: \"MyStore\",","    persistentStoreURL: storeURL,","    managedObjectModelURL: modelURL,","    cloudFileSystem: cloudFS",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The authenticator stores tokens in the Keychain and refreshes them automatically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when they expire. The default scope is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drive.file"},{"text":" (per-file access), which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"limits the app to files it creates.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Threading","anchor":"Threading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This class is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@unchecked Sendable"},{"text":". All network calls go through a shared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession"},{"text":" instance, which is thread-safe. Mutable state (caches, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loggedIn"},{"text":" flag)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is accessed only from async methods that are serialized by the ensemble’s operation queue.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem\/init(accessToken:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem\/init(authenticator:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem\/isConnected"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/G